WEBVTT

00:08.450 --> 00:11.100
Wow!

00:11.100 --> 00:13.440
It's amazing!

00:13.440 --> 00:15.530
It's so pretty!

00:20.800 --> 00:22.880
We finally made it...

00:22.880 --> 00:24.110
That was quite the trip, huh?

00:24.110 --> 00:26.240
I'm exhausted.

00:26.240 --> 00:29.150
How 'bout we get checked in
 so we can go veg out?

00:29.590 --> 00:31.060
Sounds like a plan!

00:31.060 --> 00:33.380
You really have a way with her, huh?

00:38.070 --> 00:40.190
Look, I made a faceprint!

00:40.190 --> 00:41.760
Hang on! Hold that pose!

00:41.760 --> 00:43.290
Everybody get in, get in!

00:43.290 --> 00:45.150
They all seem so hyped.

00:45.150 --> 00:47.600
I mean, look at the snow. 
Can you blame them?

00:47.920 --> 00:49.840
Yeah, I guess not.

00:49.840 --> 00:52.960
Jeez... Asahi! Let's get a move on!

00:58.960 --> 01:00.950
What's up, Mahiro-chan?

01:00.950 --> 01:03.530
Oh, nothing!

01:03.530 --> 01:04.790
Shall we get going?

01:05.590 --> 01:06.510
Sure!

01:23.680 --> 01:24.760
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:25.260 --> 01:26.390
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:28.560 --> 01:31.690
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

01:34.860 --> 01:37.900
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

02:32.710 --> 02:41.090
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

02:41.630 --> 02:45.010
<b>#12  Mahiro's Future as a Sister</b>

02:43.430 --> 02:45.000
So, guys!

02:45.000 --> 02:47.260
It's almost spring break, you know?!

02:47.640 --> 02:50.030
It'd be nice if we could 
go someplace together.

02:50.030 --> 02:54.220
That reminds me. Didn't we talk about 
that kinda thing on Halloween?

02:54.220 --> 02:58.060
Huh? That was still on the table?

02:58.690 --> 03:01.790
An onsen would be a nice change 
of pace, don't you think?

03:01.790 --> 03:03.450
It does sound nice.

03:03.450 --> 03:05.140
I'd like to go too!

03:05.140 --> 03:06.540
Me three!

03:07.540 --> 03:09.290
Okey-dokey!

03:09.290 --> 03:10.920
How about this one?

03:10.920 --> 03:12.630
Wow! That looks nice!

03:12.000 --> 03:13.500
It really does!

03:12.630 --> 03:13.940
It looks wonderful!

03:13.770 --> 03:15.190
Right?

03:14.340 --> 03:16.160
It's perfect.

03:14.600 --> 03:16.160
It's so pretty.

03:15.250 --> 03:17.020
I wanna try that!

03:16.870 --> 03:19.230
You're happy going here 
too, right, Mahiro-chan?

03:17.020 --> 03:18.400
It looks delicious.

03:19.850 --> 03:20.640
Huh?

03:23.570 --> 03:25.370
<i>And so with that...</i>

03:25.370 --> 03:27.210
<i>Before I could even blink,</i>

03:27.210 --> 03:31.390
<i>we were packing our bags for a 
one-night stay at the onsen.</i>

03:31.390 --> 03:33.400
Look, there it is!

03:41.480 --> 03:44.650
<b>Tsukimi Inn</b>

03:44.640 --> 03:47.110
Welcome, and thank you for choosing our inn.

03:47.710 --> 03:50.310
Thanks so much for having us!

03:50.310 --> 03:52.870
Thanks for having us!

03:52.870 --> 03:55.470
Well, then, if you'll all 
follow me to your room.

03:55.790 --> 03:56.670
<b>Ladies Room</b>

04:03.500 --> 04:05.400
It's got tatami mats!

04:04.550 --> 04:06.600
It's pretty spacious, too, huh?

04:07.400 --> 04:09.960
You can't have a Japanese 
inn without tatami floors!

04:09.960 --> 04:13.620
Well, then, why don't we hit the 
town while it's still light out?

04:14.500 --> 04:17.780
All right! It's time for a 
snowball fight, Miyo-chin!

04:17.780 --> 04:20.830
Um... I don't know about that.

04:20.830 --> 04:22.970
Hey, guys! Look at me!

04:24.980 --> 04:27.180
Wow!

04:29.740 --> 04:32.340
How cute! It suits you!

04:32.340 --> 04:33.760
I wanna wear one!

04:33.760 --> 04:36.140
Well, then, why don't we all get 
changed and head out?

04:36.140 --> 04:37.640
Okay!

04:37.640 --> 04:39.660
Wha? What happened to vegging out?

05:09.130 --> 05:10.640
Thank you, dear.

05:10.640 --> 05:12.200
Enjoy it while it's hot, now.

05:12.200 --> 05:13.470
Sure thing!

05:14.330 --> 05:16.280
<i>Sometimes it's hard to believe...</i>

05:14.720 --> 05:16.910
Thanks so much!

05:21.570 --> 05:22.740
Jeez!

05:23.830 --> 05:27.070
<i>Even his mannerisms have 
gotten more feminine.</i>

05:27.590 --> 05:30.500
<i>Hm? I wonder if that means anything.</i>

05:31.910 --> 05:33.760
Home sweet home!

05:33.760 --> 05:36.080
We got some good stuff!

05:36.080 --> 05:38.420
It was a little cold out there, though.

05:38.420 --> 05:41.220
Ah, the warm indoors soothes my soul...

05:41.220 --> 05:43.680
Shall we head to the baths, then?

05:43.680 --> 05:46.070
You know it's an open-air bath, right?

05:46.070 --> 05:48.860
Apparently, we'll be able to 
see the snow while we bathe!

05:48.860 --> 05:50.670
That sounds great!

05:50.670 --> 05:52.500
Let's all go in together, shall we?

05:52.500 --> 05:54.040
Okay!

05:54.030 --> 05:56.950
<b>Dining Hall</b>

05:54.030 --> 05:56.950
<b>Communal Bath</b>

06:01.730 --> 06:03.830
I hope the bath is big.

06:03.830 --> 06:05.560
You're not allowed to swim in it, okay?

06:05.560 --> 06:08.610
I wish I looked as good in 
a yukata as you do, Momiji.

06:08.610 --> 06:10.110
What's with the sass?

06:10.110 --> 06:11.490
I'm kidding, I'm sorry.

06:11.490 --> 06:13.300
I'll scrub your back for you, okay?

06:13.300 --> 06:14.660
Jeez...

06:14.660 --> 06:15.660
Okay, listen.

06:15.660 --> 06:18.460
Try not to stare, all right?

06:18.460 --> 06:19.980
What would I be staring at?

06:20.930 --> 06:29.690
<b>Hot Spring</b>

06:20.930 --> 06:29.690
<b>Ladies</b>

06:23.910 --> 06:28.910
Ooo... Yay!

06:28.910 --> 06:30.490
Don't forget to fold your clothes!

06:30.490 --> 06:31.660
Okay!

06:32.400 --> 06:34.140
Th-That's right.

06:34.140 --> 06:37.610
This is technically mixed... mixed bathing!

06:37.610 --> 06:39.400
No way! Absolutely not!

06:39.400 --> 06:41.690
These girls are my friends. 
I gotta respect that!

06:41.690 --> 06:45.120
I can't go forgetting my 
morals at a time like this.

06:52.420 --> 06:56.390
<b>Hot Spring</b>

06:52.420 --> 06:56.390
<b>Ladies</b>

06:52.780 --> 06:56.380
C'mon! Let's get you out of those clothes!

06:56.730 --> 06:58.920
What? You're too shy?

06:58.920 --> 07:01.590
Don't be silly! It's just 
us girls, after all!

07:01.590 --> 07:04.190
D-Don't do it!

07:02.530 --> 07:04.450
And a one, and a two, and a three!

07:12.250 --> 07:14.450
Wow!

07:15.220 --> 07:17.190
Wow!

07:18.660 --> 07:20.050
It's massive!

07:20.050 --> 07:22.340
What a beautiful snowscape!

07:29.530 --> 07:31.190
So relaxing...

07:31.190 --> 07:33.370
Apparently, the water's good for detoxing.

07:33.370 --> 07:34.650
Detoxing?

07:34.650 --> 07:38.260
It's when you rid the body of impurities 
that have built up over time.

07:38.260 --> 07:39.460
Neat!

07:40.540 --> 07:42.710
Toxins begone!

07:42.710 --> 07:44.560
Huh? Where's Mahiro-chan?

07:44.560 --> 07:45.090
Huh?

07:45.570 --> 07:46.480
Oh!

07:50.270 --> 07:52.560
Come hang out with us, Mahiro-chan!

07:52.560 --> 07:54.820
O-Oh, don't mind me!

07:54.820 --> 07:57.080
She's so sheepish. Must be puberty.

07:57.080 --> 07:59.040
Y-Yeah, must be...

08:00.120 --> 08:01.960
<i>Jeez, I can't relax at all.</i>

08:01.960 --> 08:04.520
<i>Forget detoxing, my impure 
thoughts are only growing!</i>

08:07.770 --> 08:10.660
<i>I-I can't help it! 
My eyes have a mind of their own!</i>

08:10.660 --> 08:13.970
<i>It's too dangerous here. 
I gotta get out of range.</i>

08:18.500 --> 08:20.900
Now I can finally relax!

08:29.110 --> 08:31.860
Bathing is so much better alone.

08:31.860 --> 08:34.850
Getting stressed out at a hot 
spring is just backwards.

08:36.000 --> 08:37.100
There it is again!

08:37.100 --> 08:39.110
That weird tingly sensation 
I felt this morning!

08:39.850 --> 08:41.570
Oh, there you are!

08:41.570 --> 08:42.290
Hm?

08:44.860 --> 08:46.580
Mahiro-chan!

08:49.860 --> 08:51.540
Can I sit with you?

08:55.970 --> 08:59.240
It's a little embarrassing, us all 
bathing together like this.

08:59.240 --> 09:01.500
Oh— Uh, yeah...

09:01.500 --> 09:04.570
The view from here is nice, too!

09:09.020 --> 09:11.470
C'mon, Asahi! Diving is against the rules!

09:25.100 --> 09:26.190
What?

09:26.190 --> 09:27.460
Nothing, it's just...

09:27.460 --> 09:30.500
With you two, I don't have to worry 
about averting my eyes.

09:30.500 --> 09:32.470
What? Because I'm flat-chested?!

09:32.470 --> 09:34.380
Oh, Mahiron...

09:34.960 --> 09:37.750
Uh! No, um, that's not what I meant...

09:37.750 --> 09:40.090
Uh— Um— You know? Err...

09:40.090 --> 09:42.690
Hee hee hee hee...

09:43.390 --> 09:45.510
Take this, and that, and this!

09:47.280 --> 09:50.100
Tickle, tickle, tickle, tickle.

09:53.010 --> 09:54.170
And how about that?!

09:54.170 --> 09:56.570
I can't take this much longer!

09:57.030 --> 09:58.280
<i>Whoa!</i>

09:58.650 --> 10:00.280
<i>Wait? No way...</i>

10:00.280 --> 10:02.730
<i>I know this feeling all too well...</i>

10:08.160 --> 10:09.950
Where's the big reaction?!

10:09.950 --> 10:11.900
We could go all day, you know?!

10:13.220 --> 10:15.080
<i>It has returned...</i>

10:17.050 --> 10:17.130
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.130 --> 10:17.250
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.250 --> 10:17.380
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.350 --> 10:18.790
Onimai.

10:17.380 --> 10:17.500
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.500 --> 10:17.630
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.630 --> 10:17.710
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.710 --> 10:17.750
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.750 --> 10:17.880
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:17.880 --> 10:18.090
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:18.090 --> 10:19.090
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:21.130 --> 10:23.090
<b>ONIMAI</b>

10:21.770 --> 10:23.090
Onimai.

10:23.090 --> 10:24.400
Take this!

10:25.740 --> 10:27.280
Ey!

10:27.920 --> 10:29.650
Tickle, tickle, tickle.

10:33.620 --> 10:34.910
Squidgy?

10:35.620 --> 10:37.300
What's wrong?

10:38.040 --> 10:40.140
T-T...

10:40.910 --> 10:45.100
Time out!

10:49.730 --> 10:51.110
What is it? What's wrong?

10:57.730 --> 10:59.340
What's the matter, Mihari?

10:59.340 --> 11:02.210
W-Well, um... Er...

11:02.210 --> 11:05.830
M-Mahiro-chan says she's feeling 
a little light-headed, so...

11:05.830 --> 11:07.790
Really? Oh, no!

11:07.790 --> 11:10.130
She does look a little pale, 
now that you mention it.

11:11.630 --> 11:12.560
Not to worry!

11:12.560 --> 11:16.310
Just stay put and enjoy 
yourself with the others!

11:17.220 --> 11:19.380
What's up with Mahiro-chan?

11:19.380 --> 11:20.890
The hot water got to her, apparently.

11:20.890 --> 11:22.190
What a baby.

11:37.320 --> 11:40.710
Looks like the drug has 
finally started to wear off.

11:40.710 --> 11:43.270
Perhaps the hot spring played a role as well.

11:43.600 --> 11:47.420
At this rate, you'll be fully 
reverted by tomorrow morning.

11:47.420 --> 11:49.360
B-But we can't let that happen!

11:49.360 --> 11:51.120
Everyone's gonna find out!

11:51.120 --> 11:52.830
You're right.

11:52.830 --> 11:55.950
Besides, this is all so sudden.

11:55.950 --> 11:58.870
And I was really enjoying this trip, too...

12:00.060 --> 12:01.580
Onii-chan...

12:09.950 --> 12:11.370
It's gonna be okay.

12:11.810 --> 12:12.850
After all...

12:14.090 --> 12:17.510
I brought the drug with me just 
in case of such an emergency!

12:17.510 --> 12:20.290
Wh-Why didn't you say so earlier?!

12:20.580 --> 12:21.960
Honestly...

12:21.960 --> 12:23.360
But are you sure about this?

12:23.950 --> 12:27.720
If you take it, you'll be stuck 
as a girl for a while longer.

12:29.690 --> 12:32.300
You won't be able to turn 
back for a long time.

12:39.820 --> 12:41.830
We're back!

12:46.480 --> 12:48.890
I'm glad you seem to be feeling better!

12:48.890 --> 12:51.990
Y-Yeah! Just felt a little dizzy, is all.

12:51.990 --> 12:53.730
We were worried!

12:53.730 --> 12:55.520
Maybe it was fatigue.

12:55.520 --> 12:57.100
I'm glad you're better now, though!

12:58.770 --> 13:00.920
That was so relaxing, though, wasn't it?

13:00.920 --> 13:03.090
That felt great!

13:04.550 --> 13:06.330
We could go back in again!

13:06.330 --> 13:07.510
I'd be down for that!

13:08.820 --> 13:11.430
Wow!

13:11.940 --> 13:13.610
This is so fancy!

13:13.610 --> 13:14.690
It's a feast!

13:14.690 --> 13:16.820
It's amazing! There's so much food!

13:16.820 --> 13:20.380
Cod milt tempura, roast 
venison, and boar stew!

13:20.380 --> 13:21.930
There's even grated yam!

13:21.930 --> 13:24.070
What an nourishing meal!

13:24.660 --> 13:27.190
It's so creamy and tasty!

13:27.190 --> 13:29.680
What does "cod milt" mean, anyway?

13:29.680 --> 13:31.530
I'll tell you.

13:31.530 --> 13:32.770
Oh...

13:34.240 --> 13:35.830
Sho good!

13:36.590 --> 13:38.520
I'm gonna have another one!

13:36.820 --> 13:39.120
Have you tried this yet? It's really good!

13:39.940 --> 13:41.650
This one's yummy, too!

13:43.940 --> 13:46.630
Huh? Aren't you gonna eat 
something, Mahiro-chan?

13:46.630 --> 13:47.560
Huh?

13:47.560 --> 13:50.390
Oh, uh... I will, I will!

13:53.650 --> 13:55.970
Thanks for the meal!

13:56.370 --> 13:58.660
I loved every single dish!

13:58.660 --> 14:00.780
I wanna learn how to plate food like that.

14:00.780 --> 14:02.820
I don't think I can get up.

14:02.820 --> 14:04.840
You'll turn into a cow if you 
sleep right after you eat!

14:04.840 --> 14:05.990
Moo!

14:05.990 --> 14:08.000
Moo, moo!

14:08.790 --> 14:11.320
Wait! I think it's snowing!

14:11.320 --> 14:13.070
What? Really?

14:13.070 --> 14:14.260
It is?

14:14.760 --> 14:17.250
It's snowing? Let me see!

14:17.250 --> 14:20.020
See? It's really snowing!

14:21.860 --> 14:23.050
It's so pretty.

14:23.050 --> 14:24.290
It's amazing.

14:24.290 --> 14:26.050
I'm so glad we came here.

14:26.050 --> 14:30.000
Shall we go check out the garden 
while we walk off the food?

14:30.000 --> 14:31.790
Okay!

14:32.670 --> 14:34.370
I wonder how cold it is.

14:34.370 --> 14:35.940
Let's take pictures!

14:34.580 --> 14:36.050
Come with us, Mahiro-chan.

14:36.050 --> 14:36.880
Huh?

14:40.900 --> 14:43.180
S-Sure...

14:59.220 --> 15:00.620
Hey, look!

15:03.710 --> 15:06.320
Whatcha think? Don't we look great?

15:07.440 --> 15:10.090
All right, I'm taking a picture!

15:10.090 --> 15:12.110
Yay!

15:12.110 --> 15:13.980
You'll pay!

15:14.420 --> 15:16.680
Take this, Momijiro!

15:17.370 --> 15:18.860
I read you like a book!

15:24.240 --> 15:25.760
Take that!

15:32.300 --> 15:34.470
M-Miyo-chan?

15:35.410 --> 15:38.290
You seem a little down, Mahiro-chan.

15:40.450 --> 15:41.830
Miyo-chan...

15:45.180 --> 15:46.000
Thank—

15:46.000 --> 15:46.840
Ouch!

15:48.330 --> 15:50.760
Bull's-eye!

15:51.620 --> 15:54.710
Asahi! Just you wait!

15:54.710 --> 15:57.440
Surprise attacks don't count, you know?!

15:58.060 --> 16:00.180
You've done it now.

16:05.950 --> 16:09.100
It's been so long since I 
played in the snow.

16:13.540 --> 16:15.400
It's cold!

16:16.090 --> 16:17.570
That's right.

16:17.570 --> 16:20.990
If I turned back now, I'd be 
giving up on all of this, huh?

16:21.940 --> 16:25.720
And... I'm kinda happy 
with the way things are.

17:08.550 --> 17:09.730
Over there!

17:09.730 --> 17:10.580
Where?

17:10.580 --> 17:12.380
Look! Right there!

17:13.380 --> 17:15.900
Mahiron! Get over here!

17:37.020 --> 17:39.480
I wanna keep playing!

17:39.480 --> 17:42.200
Sleeping does feel like a bit 
of a wasted opportunity, huh?

17:42.200 --> 17:44.660
Well, we still have all 
day tomorrow, remember?

17:44.660 --> 17:46.420
I guess you're right.

17:46.270 --> 17:49.630
It feels like we're on a 
field trip, doesn't it?

17:46.420 --> 17:46.930
Right.

17:46.930 --> 17:47.630
Yeah, I guess so.

17:47.630 --> 17:48.890
Let's play more tomorrow!

17:48.890 --> 17:51.230
Sure thing! What should we do?

17:51.230 --> 17:54.670
Oh, right. I guess you missed 
out on those, skipping grades.

17:55.520 --> 17:57.290
We should do this again sometime.

17:57.290 --> 17:59.520
Yeah, we should!

17:59.520 --> 18:00.970
Where should we go next?

18:00.970 --> 18:02.330
Honduras!

18:03.400 --> 18:04.650
Why there?

18:04.650 --> 18:06.090
Where even is that?

18:06.090 --> 18:07.060
I have no idea!

18:07.580 --> 18:09.170
Is it even in Japan?

18:26.950 --> 18:28.180
Squidgy?

18:53.490 --> 18:55.150
Smooth...

18:55.150 --> 18:56.460
Smooth?

19:07.940 --> 19:10.350
I-I'm in the clear?

19:11.410 --> 19:14.830
<b>Tsukimi Inn</b>

19:19.900 --> 19:21.580
Miyo-chin!

19:21.580 --> 19:22.920
Boo!

19:24.840 --> 19:26.830
What are you doing?

19:25.350 --> 19:27.220
Bet you I can fit ten more.

19:27.220 --> 19:27.860
No way!

19:27.860 --> 19:31.520
How did I end up sleeping 
on your futon last night?

19:31.520 --> 19:33.450
I don't remember a thing.

19:33.450 --> 19:37.140
R-Really? You were probably just sleepwalking.

19:37.140 --> 19:39.400
All I remember is something squidgy.

19:41.400 --> 19:43.630
All right, guys! Let's get going!

19:43.630 --> 19:45.010
Are you all set?

19:45.010 --> 19:46.540
All set!

19:47.100 --> 19:49.080
Thanks for the lovely stay!

19:49.080 --> 19:51.380
We hope to see you again!

19:51.380 --> 19:52.460
Thank you!

19:56.560 --> 19:58.660
Thanks, we'd love to!

20:17.140 --> 20:18.870
They've all fallen asleep, huh?

20:21.680 --> 20:24.800
So you chose this route in the end, huh?

20:24.800 --> 20:26.840
What do you mean?

20:26.840 --> 20:29.070
You chose to take the medicine, right?

20:29.410 --> 20:34.560
W-Well, it wasn't exactly the best 
time to be changing back, you know?

20:34.560 --> 20:36.070
Is that all?

20:36.850 --> 20:39.940
I-It's not that I wanna 
stay a girl or anything.

20:40.370 --> 20:41.210
It's just...

20:41.210 --> 20:44.840
I'd like things to stay this way 
just a little while longer.

20:46.270 --> 20:47.670
What's so funny?

20:53.500 --> 20:56.190
You've really changed, 
haven't you, Onii-chan?

20:56.840 --> 20:58.780
I don't just mean your appearance.

20:58.780 --> 21:02.550
I guess you could say the rehabilitation 
project was a resounding success.

21:02.550 --> 21:04.580
R-Rehabilitation project?

21:04.580 --> 21:06.600
You conniving little sister!

21:06.600 --> 21:08.400
You'll pay for this once I turn back, you hear?!

21:08.400 --> 21:09.110
Hmph!

21:09.850 --> 21:11.060
Yeah, yeah.

21:11.060 --> 21:14.860
But in the meantime, here's to your 
